{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "layout",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## SafeSponsor AI — Site Architecture\n\n**Stack**: Next 16.3.1 + Tailwind 4 + motion/react + R3F + Firestore\n\n**Fonts**: Instrument Serif (display) + Inter (body/UI)\n\n**Tokens**: ink #0F1B2E / paper #F6F2EF / risk #E07A5F / line #49A9DE"
    },
    {
      "id": "marketing",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Marketing (16px bento)\n\n- `/` — Landing (hero + RadarGlobe + pricing + FAQ)\n- `/blog` — Blog index (28px serif)\n- `/blog/[slug]` — Blog post\n- `/privacy` — Privacy policy\n- `/terms` — Terms of service\n- `/brand-safety/*` — Platform pages (IG, TikTok, Twitch, YT)"
    },
    {
      "id": "app",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Application (8px audit cards)\n\n- `/dashboard` — Analytics + batch history\n- `/dashboard/dossier-viewer` — 7-section dossier\n- `/login` — Auth (Firebase)\n\n**Dossier sections**: Persona · Verdict · Audience · PR · Competitor · Red Flags · Highlights"
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## API Routes\n\n- `/api/analyze` — Creator analysis\n- `/api/checkout` — DodoPayments\n- `/api/webhook` — Payment webhook\n- `/api/save-dossier` — Firestore save\n- `/api/history` — Batch history\n- `/api/lead` — Email capture\n- `/api/health` — Status check"
    },
    {
      "id": "components",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Components\n\n- `Navbar` — 72px, blur(12px), ss monogram\n- `RadarGlobe` — WebGL points-sphere + scan ring\n- `MethodDiagram` — 7-step pipeline (stagger reveal)\n- `PlatformPage` — Platform landing template\n- `TeaserWidget` — Audit teaser (score chips)\n- `AuthProvider` — Firebase auth context"
    },
    {
      "id": "design",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Design System (Ink Auditor)\n\n**Voice**: Calm Auditor + Risk Radar\n**Palette**: ink / paper / risk / line\n**Type**: Instrument Serif (H1-H3) + Inter (body)\n**Layout**: 16px bento (marketing) + 8px audit (dossier)\n**Motion**: L2 editorial scroll (150-250ms)\n**Texture**: Noise grain overlay (5% opacity)"
    },
    {
      "id": "data",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "7",
      "text": "## Data Layer\n\n- **Firestore**: dossiers, users, leads, batches\n- **Firebase Admin**: server-side auth\n- **DodoPayments**: checkout + webhooks\n- **Providers**: YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Twitch, X\n- **Cache**: 90-day PII-scrubbed dossiers"
    },
    {
